- Keep Bluetooth operations asynchronous to avoid blocking the interface
- Prevent saved badge filename collisions and save presets atomically
- Suspend inactive and static preview animations
- Replace the speed selector with a slider
- Add My Backup support for saved badges and app preferences
- Add host regression tests for transfers, presets and previews
- Remove older RPMs when publishing package updates

